# The phi of two string-literal address constants (`x ? "A" : "B"`) must emit,
# in EACH of the two predecessors, the bank half of the far pointer next to the
# offset word. Two predecessors -> exactly two of each.
#
# Bank half: `lda.w #:sym` (WLA-DX `:` = 8-bit bank operator). Was missing.
# The `(\w+_)?` allows the per-TU anonymous-label prefix (<tu>_string.N).
count 2 lda\.w #:(\w+_)?string
# Offset word: `lda.w #sym` (no colon). Present before and after the fix.
count 2 lda\.w #(\w+_)?string\.[0-9]
